WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.520
[Connection tone]

1
00:00:01.877 --> 00:00:05.807
Emily: Good afternoon, you're through to Emily at Holcim. How can I help?

2
00:00:09.227 --> 00:00:24.078
Jamie: Alright Emily. I need to sort some concrete for next Tuesday. Doing an extension and doing a new driveway in Somerset. Building control is being a bit of a nightmare though, so I want to make sure I get the right mix for the footings. What do you reckon?

3
00:00:26.527 --> 00:00:41.535
Emily: Not a problem at all. For standard extension footings, building control usually looks for a GEN3 mix, or an RC35 mix if the ground is a bit tricky. I can quote you for the RC35 just to be on the safe side?

4
00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:49.732
Jamie: Yeah, let's go with the RC35. Better safe than sorry. Need about 15 cubes.

5
00:00:51.527 --> 00:01:06.108
Emily: Got it. 15 cubic metres of RC35. Now, since you mentioned doing a new driveway as well, have you got your base materials sorted yet? We can send over some MOT Type 1 from our local quarry on the same delivery day.

6
00:01:08.187 --> 00:01:18.209
Jamie: Oh right, actually no, I haven't sorted that. I'll probably need about 20 tonnes of Type 1. What about the actual tarmac? Do you do that too?

7
00:01:20.707 --> 00:01:31.370
Emily: We do. For a residential drive, I'd highly recommend our SuperDrive Asphalt. It handles power steering scuffs really well. I can put it all on one quote for you?

8
00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:38.493
Jamie: Yeah, brilliant. Saves me ringing round. Chuck it all on an email.

